<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's real ends flat in quiet session.</title>
<headline>Brazil's real ends flat in quiet session.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's real closed flat at 1.0511 to the dollar in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>In the interbank foreign exchange floating rate market, the real rose 0.03 percent to close at 1.0566 reais to the dollar, they added.</p>
<p>In the illegal parallel market, the real rose 0.46 percent to end at 1.09 to the dollar.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom 55-11-2485415))</p>
